<title>ITALY: Olivetti up on Mannesmann talks.</title>
<headline>Olivetti up on Mannesmann talks.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Italy's Olivetti spiked 8.6 percent to 478.5 lire after confirmation from German engineering group Mannesmann AG that talks about taking a stake in Omnitel Sistemi Cellulari could be concluded today.</p>
<p>But shares in the troubled information technology group had retraced by 1525 GMT to stand 2.81 percent up on the day at 453 lire per share.</p>
</text>
